<apex:page controller="WelcomeLetterController"
           contentType="application/msword#{!fileName}.doc"
           cache="true"
           applyBodyTag="false"
           showHeader="false"
           standardStylesheets="false">

    <html>
        <head>
        <style>
            body {
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                font-size: 12pt;
                margin: 1in;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }
            .date {
                text-align: right;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }
            .salutation {
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }
            .content {
                text-align: justify;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }
            .closing {
                margin-top: 30px;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div style="margin-bottom:10px;"><c:WDDocLogo word="true"/></div>

        <div class="date">
            Date: {!letter.letterDate}
        </div>

        <div class="salutation">
            Dear {!letter.customerName},
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            Congratulations on becoming a proud owner at <b>{!letter.projectName}</b>, 
            <b>{!letter.projectAddress}</b>. 
            We confirm your booking of a <b>{!letter.configuration}</b>, No <b>{!letter.unitNumber}</b>, 
            of Carpet Area <b>{!letter.carpetArea} SqFt</b>. 
            on <b>{!letter.floorNumber}</b> of Tower: <b>{!letter.towerName}</b>.
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            Thank you for placing your valued trust in us. 
            We now hope to exceed your expectations in terms of service, construction quality 
            and delivery, in the days to come. 
            As you are aware, we at <b>"WarpDrive Tech Works"</b> have consistently completed 
            all our projects exceeding our client's expectations in terms of quality and schedules 
            and we have all intentions of doing the same with <b>{!letter.projectName}</b>.
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            In conclusion, may we once again thank you for being a part of us and look forward 
            to a long and happy relationship. 
            We solicit your continued support and patronage in our brand.
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            Welcome to the <b>WarpDrive family</b>.
        </div>

        <div class="closing">
            Warm Regards,<br/>
            From <b>WarpDrive Tech Works</b>,<br/><br/><br/><br/>
            <p style="margin-top:40px;">______________________________</p>
            <p>Authorised Signatory.</p>
        </div>

    </body>
    </html>
</apex:page>